    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Host burden of the two-input gate"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Directive \u2014 Measure the growth cost now, so the three-input result can be attributed to design rather than to physiology."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Method"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Specific growth rate from OD600 across the exponential window, gate versus empty "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-825ea421",
              "label": "DVK_EF",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-825ea421",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVK_EF",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", four biological replicates."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Growth rate, not final OD. Final OD conflates rate with yield and is insensitive to exactly the burden being looked for."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Result"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fully induced gate grows 14 percent slower than the empty-vector control. Uninduced is within noise, so the cost is expression, not plasmid maintenance."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Projection, and why it is only a projection"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Naive linear extrapolation puts a three-input gate near 21 percent, just outside the charter limit. Burden is not linear in expression load, so this is a flag rather than a prediction \u2014 entry 11 tests mitigation before entry 12 spends the build."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
